(7728865, 1272495, 103142, '<td valign="top">This was an 8 from me. Very beautifully and realistically done. It didnt look computer generated</td>', 'This was an 8 from me. Very beautifully and realistically done. It didnt look computer generated', '2022-08-29 13:07:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7728866, 1272495, 81362, '<td valign="top">The flowers mainly have my oldest daughter to thank, as she collected the blooms from her garden and put together the arrangements in preparation for her sister''s back yard wedding reception party. I did use Dynamic Auto Painter set to "Monet" to generate a painterly effect that I applied as a layer with partial opacity. But I masked out the majority of the effect over the flowers themselves, which is why there might be a somewhat naturalistic impression. Late afternoon sun illuminated the flowers, which received a bit of additional brightening with curves and were brought out further with a bit of clarity adjustment and set off by a mild vignette.  Lovely afternoon, and I am glad to have this image from that day.</td>', 'The flowers mainly have my oldest daughter to thank, as she collected the blooms from her garden and put together the arrangements in preparation for her sister''s back yard wedding reception party. I did use Dynamic Auto Painter set to "Monet" to generate a painterly effect that I applied as a layer with partial opacity. But I masked out the majority of the effect over the flowers themselves, which is why there might be a somewhat naturalistic impression. Late afternoon sun illuminated the flowers, which received a bit of additional brightening with curves and were brought out further with a bit of clarity adjustment and set off by a mild vignette.  Lovely afternoon, and I am glad to have this image from that day.', '2022-08-29 13:35:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(7728870, 1272495, 103142, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bob350:</b></div><hr/><i> The flowers mainly have my oldest daughter to thank, as she collected the blooms from her garden and put together the arrangements in preparation for her sister''s back yard wedding reception party. I did use Dynamic Auto Painter set to "Monet" to generate a painterly effect that I applied as a layer with partial opacity. But I masked out the majority of the effect over the flowers themselves, which is why there might be a somewhat naturalistic impression. Late afternoon sun illuminated the flowers, which received a bit of additional brightening with curves and were brought out further with a bit of clarity adjustment and set off by a mild vignette.  Lovely afternoon, and I am glad to have this image from that day. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Cool - I dont know Dynamic Auto Painter - Ill have to look it up! You should print this out for their house.</td>', 'Originally posted by bob350: The flowers mainly have my oldest daughter to thank, as she collected the blooms from her garden and put together the arrangements in preparation for her sister''s back yard wedding reception party. I did use Dynamic Auto Painter set to "Monet" to generate a painterly effect that I applied as a layer with partial opacity. But I masked out the majority of the effect over the flowers themselves, which is why there might be a somewhat naturalistic impression. Late afternoon sun illuminated the flowers, which received a bit of additional brightening with curves and were brought out further with a bit of clarity adjustment and set off by a mild vignette.  Lovely afternoon, and I am glad to have this image from that day.   Cool - I dont know Dynamic Auto Painter - Ill have to look it up! You should print this out for their house.', '2022-08-29 14:34:29.000000', NULL, 0),
